---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Meet the creator of Smartivate Hub." />
		<style>
			.about-hero { padding: 5rem 1rem; text-align: center; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 20px; margin: 2rem auto; max-width: 1200px; }
			.about-hero h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			
			.content-section { max-width: 800px; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #334155; font-size: 1.1rem; }
			.content-section h2 { color: #0f172a; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
			
			.ecosystem-box { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; margin: 3rem 0; }
			.eco-card { padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; background: white; }
			.eco-card h3 { color: #4f46e5; margin-top: 0; }
			
			.mission-statement { background: #4f46e5; color: white; padding: 3rem; border-radius: 16px; text-align: center; margin-top: 4rem; }
			
			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.about-hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
				.ecosystem-box { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section class="about-hero">
				<span style="color: #4f46e5; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">The Story Behind</span>
				<h1>Smartivate Hub</h1>
				<p style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: #64748b; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
					Helping you build AI-powered lead generation and cold email systems — without the guesswork.
				</p>
			</section>

			<article class="content-section">
				<p>Welcome to <strong>Smartivate Hub</strong> — a platform focused on teaching you how to find leads, extract contact data, and send cold email outreach using AI, automation, and your own email infrastructure.</p>
				<p>My name is <strong>Shadrack Arthur-Mensah</strong>, and I created Smartivate Hub to make lead generation and cold email something you can actually build yourself — not something you have to pay $300+ a month for.</p>

				<h2>My Journey</h2>
				<p>I started like many beginners — stuck choosing between expensive lead databases that went stale fast, or burning hours manually searching for businesses one at a time. Instead of settling for either, I started building: testing AI tools like Gemini and Claude for lead generation, automating workflows with n8n, Make, and Zapier, and setting up my own SMTP infrastructure to send outreach that actually lands in the inbox.</p>
				<p>Over time, I realized most people don't need another tool — they need a clear system, and someone willing to show every step, not just the finished result.</p>

				<div class="ecosystem-box">
					<div class="eco-card">
						<h3>Smartivate Hub</h3>
						<p>Your learning center. Step-by-step tutorials on AI lead generation, email infrastructure, and cold outreach — free on YouTube and right here on the blog.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="eco-card">
						<h3>Smartivate</h3>
						<p>Your execution center. The tools I personally built and use — including LeadHarvester, BulkGrab, InboxJet, and Mailverix — at <a href="http://www.smartivatetech.com" style="color: #4f46e5;">smartivatetech.com</a>.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h2>What You'll Learn</h2>
				<ul>
				    <li>Clear and simple guides on complex tech</li>
                    <li>Step-by-step tutorials for modern tools</li>
                    <li>Real-world projects built from scratch</li>
                    <li>Practical workflows you can apply immediately</li>
					<li>How to set up your own SMTP server and email infrastructure</li>
					<li>How to generate and extract leads using AI (Gemini, Claude, ChatGPT)</li>
					<li>How to scrape Google Maps and LinkedIn for qualified leads</li>
					<li>How to send cold email campaigns that avoid the spam folder</li>
					<li>Real automation workflows built with n8n, Make, and Zapier</li>
				</ul>

				<div class="mission-statement">
					<h2>Our Mission</h2>
					<p style="font-size: 1.2rem;">To help you go from manually chasing leads to running your own automated, AI-powered outreach system — using practical skills that actually work.</p>
				</div>
			</article>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>